Every one of these questions is basically asking you to do some combination of:

A. Encrypt something
So that unauthorized people cannot read it.

B. Hash something
So that you can detect whether it was changed.

C. Sign something
So that you can prove who created/sent it.

D. Decrypt it
Only after checking that it hasn't been tampered with and that the signature is valid.

E. Give different users different permissions
That's RBAC — Role-Based Access Control.



            Encryption pipeline
             ORIGINAL FILE
                   |
                   v
              ENCRYPTION
              AES / DES / RSA
                   |
                   v
